    <string name="settings_about_title">Ku saabsan</string>
    <string name="settings_about_p1">App-kan waa shaqo daacad ah oo loogu talagalay oo keliya raalli ahaanshaha Allah, hadiyad loogu talagalay Muslim kasta oo lab iyo dheddig ah, anigoo rajaynaya ajar aniga, waalidkay, qoyskayga iyo dhammaan Muslimiinta.</string>
    <string name="settings_about_p2">Waxaa loo horumariyay oo loo dhisay jacayl iyo xamaasad si loogu adeego Kitaabka Allah. Mashruucan si buuxda ayuu u furan yahay, qof kasta oo horumariye ah ama xiiseeyaana wuu baari karaa, wax ka beddeli karaa, dib u isticmaali karaa, oo wadaagi karaa si loo sameeyo barnaamijyo u adeega Islaamka iyo Muslimiinta. Kii dadka kale u hoggaamiya khayrka wuxuu helayaa ajar sida kii khayrka sameeya.</string>
    <string name="settings_about_p3">Waxaan idin weydiisanaynaa inaad noogu ducaysaan marka aannan idinla joogin.</string>
    <string name="settings_about_open_source_title">Mashruuc furan</string>
    <string name="settings_about_open_source_text">Mashruucan waa mid furan, qof walbana wuu ka faa’iidaysan karaa, horumarin karaa, kuna tabaruci karaa si uu ugu adeego Kitaabka Allah, isagoo rajaynaya ajar Allah.</string>
